  "status": "formal",
  "supportedClaim": "A fixed positive inviscid cluster persists for all sufficiently small viscosity: the contour resolvent is uniformly bounded, the Riesz projections converge in operator norm, rank and total algebraic multiplicity are preserved, and all cluster eigenvalues converge to the inviscid value. The contour and threshold are not explicit; simplicity, rates, complement control, fast-time transfer, nonlinear Navier--Stokes control, and Clay remain open."
